# Found sound is fetched from the Internet Archive, never committed.
# It's external CC-licensed material (see ../SOURCES.md) and, like the renders,
# fully regenerable: ../fetch-found-sound.sh. Ignore everything here but keep
# the directory and this file.
*
!.gitignore
# EXCEPTION: the found-sound local-cache manifest is SOURCE (maps each archive.org
# foundSource URL -> its processed local file so the LIVE app prefers the cache and
# never streams archive.org for anything already downloaded). Small, committed;
# the found/*.wav it points at stay ignored (regenerable: ../fetch-found-*.sh).
!found-manifest.json
# EXCEPTION: the live-video stream catalog is SOURCE (cue windows + genre tags
# into remote archive.org files), committed like clips is derived. The local
# found/video/*.mp4 clips stay ignored — they're a regenerable cache / fallback.
!video/
video/*
!video/stream-catalog.json
